{"nisiCoursePack":1,"schemaVersion":1,"id":"st0095-v1-2","familyId":"ST0095","version":"1.2","title":"Bricklayer — ST0095 v1.2","shortTitle":"Bricklayer","standard":"ST0095 v1.2","standardId":"ST0095","courseType":"apprenticeship","coverageLabel":"KSB","learningLabel":"OTJ","fourthLabel":"EPA","otjMinimumHours":578,"gatewayBufferMonths":3,"epaConfigured":true,"compatStorageSuffix":"","codes":["K1","K2","K3","K4","K5","K6","K7","K8","K9","K10","K11","K12","K13","K14","K15","K16","K17","K18","K19","K20","K21","K22","K23","K24","K25","K26","K27","K28","K29","K30","K31","S1","S2","S3","S4","S5","S6","S7","S8","S9","S10","S11","S12","S13","S14","S15","S16","S17","S18","S19","S20","S21","S22","B1","B2","B3","B4","B5","B6"],"codeDescriptions":{"K1":"Health and safety regulations, standards and guidance relevant to bricklaying and the role.","K2":"Safety control equipment, PPE and RPE and how they are used.","K3":"Safe systems of work including inductions, toolbox talks, risk assessments and method statements.","K4":"Environmental impact, resource efficiency, recycling, reuse, waste disposal and surface-water protection.","K5":"Sustainability and building performance including thermal qualities, airtightness and ventilation.","K6":"Principles of building construction including foundations, roofs, walls, floors, services, insulation, fire and moisture protection.","K7":"Industry standards and regulations including British Standards, Building Regulations and warranty requirements.","K8":"Bricklaying materials and components including bricks, blocks, mortar, DPCs, ties, lintels, insulation and related materials.","K9":"Modern methods of construction including rapid build, precast, profiles, alternative frames and masonry support.","K10":"How to interpret and extract information from drawings and specifications.","K11":"Principles of digital design and modelling used in construction.","K12":"How to estimate bricklaying resources and quantities.","K13":"Hand tools: selection, use, maintenance and storage.","K14":"Power tools: use, limitations and safe application.","K15":"Brick bond types including English, Flemish, garden wall and broken bond.","K16":"Setting out, constructing and capping simple solid brick walls.","K17":"Joint finishes including half round, flush, weather struck and recessed.","K18":"Decorative walling and piers including projecting or contrasting brickwork and isolated or attached piers.","K19":"Expansion and movement joints in masonry.","K20":"Mortar ratios, silos, premix, gauging and hand or mechanical mixing.","K21":"Setting out cavity walls using bricks, blocks, openings, levels, profiles, gauge rods and squares.","K22":"Cavity wall construction including stretcher bond walling, openings, cavity closure, wall ties, insulation, DPCs, trays, weeps, lintels and fire stopping.","K23":"Setting out and constructing brick-on-edge and soldier courses.","K24":"Common masonry defects and simple repair methods.","K25":"Protecting materials and finished work from frost, water and construction damage.","K26":"Verbal communication and construction terminology.","K27":"Principles of effective team working.","K28":"Inclusion, equity and diversity in the workplace.","K29":"Cutting bricks and blocks with hand tools.","K30":"Setting out and constructing walls with a raking cut.","K31":"Mental and physical wellbeing and where support can be found.","S1":"Comply with health and safety requirements and safe working practices.","S2":"Identify, select and use PPE, RPE and safety controls.","S3":"Work sustainably and segregate materials for reuse, recycling and disposal.","S4":"Comply with industry regulations, standards and guidance.","S5":"Interpret drawings and specifications for the work.","S6":"Estimate and select the required resources.","S7":"Prepare and maintain a safe working area.","S8":"Select and use hand tools and equipment.","S9":"Maintain and store hand tools correctly.","S10":"Set out a brick and block cavity wall, including an opening, to required tolerances.","S11":"Construct a stretcher bond brick and block cavity wall with return and opening to required tolerances, including key cavity-wall components.","S12":"Form specified mortar joint finishes.","S13":"Set out and construct a simple solid wall with capping.","S14":"Gauge and hand mix mortar to the required ratio.","S15":"Measure and cut bricks and blocks with hand tools to required tolerances.","S16":"Carry out a simple masonry repair.","S17":"Protect materials and finished work.","S18":"Communicate verbally using appropriate construction terminology.","S19":"Follow equality, diversity and inclusion requirements.","S20":"Apply team-working principles.","S21":"Identify sources of wellbeing support.","S22":"Construct a brick wall with a raking cut.","B1":"Put health, safety and wellbeing first.","B2":"Consider the environment when using resources and carrying out work.","B3":"Take ownership of the quality and completion of work.","B4":"Contribute to an inclusive and diverse culture.","B5":"Seek and respond to learning and development opportunities.","B6":"Work as part of the wider build team."},"siteData":[{"id":"labour","title":"Labouring & getting ready","jobs":[{"id":"setup_safe","title":"Setting up safely","opps":[{"id":"safe_area","title":"Safe work area","instruction":"Get a photo showing how you have set up a safe working area.","question":"What hazards did you check for, and what did you do to make the area safe?","codes":["K1","K3","S1","S7","B1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"},{"id":"ppe","title":"PPE for the job","instruction":"Get a photo showing the PPE or RPE you are using for this work.","question":"What PPE or RPE are you using here, and why do you need it?","codes":["K2","S2","B1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"},{"id":"safe_system","title":"Safe system of work","instruction":"Get a photo of the RAMS, briefing, exclusion area or another safe system being used.","question":"What safe system are you following for this job?","codes":["K3","S1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"},{"id":"ppe_controls","title":"PPE / RPE","instruction":"Get a photo showing the PPE or RPE being used.","question":"Why is this PPE or RPE suitable for the work you are doing?","codes":["K2","S2","B1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"},{"id":"dust_control","title":"Dust control","instruction":"Get a photo showing how dust is being controlled.","question":"What is the dust risk here, and how are you controlling it?","codes":["K1","K2","S1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"},{"id":"work_area","title":"Keep the area safe","instruction":"Get a photo showing the work area kept clear and safe.","question":"What are you doing to keep this area safe while you work?","codes":["K1","K3","S7"],"bundle":"Safe Working"}]},{"id":"mortar","title":"Mixing mortar","opps":[{"id":"mortar_materials","title":"Materials & ratio","instruction":"Get a photo showing the materials or measured ingredients before mixing.","question":"What ratio are you using, and how are you gauging the materials?","codes":["K20","S14"],"bundle":"Mortar & Jointing"},{"id":"mortar_mix","title":"Mix the mortar","instruction":"Get a photo showing the mixer, mixing setup or mortar during the mix.","question":"How are you mixing the mortar on this job?","codes":["K20","S14"],"bundle":"Mortar & Jointing"},{"id":"mortar_consistency","title":"Finished consistency","instruction":"Get a photo showing the finished mortar consistency.","question":"How do you know this mortar is ready to use?","codes":["K20","S14"],"bundle":"Mortar & Jointing"}]},{"id":"materials_qty","title":"Materials & quantities","opps":[{"id":"select_materials","title":"Choose the materials","instruction":"Get a photo of the materials or components you selected for the job.","question":"What did you select, and why is it suitable for this work?","codes":["K8","S6"],"bundle":"Materials & Tools"},{"id":"estimate_qty","title":"Work out quantities","instruction":"Get a photo of the area, materials or notes you used to work out what was needed.","question":"How did you work out the quantity of materials needed for this job?","codes":["K12","S6"],"bundle":"Materials & Tools"},{"id":"building_parts","title":"Building components","instruction":"Get a photo showing how this part of the wall or building connects with another component.","question":"What building components are working together here, and what does each one do?","codes":["K6","K8"],"bundle":"Building Principles"}]},{"id":"waste_env","title":"Waste & environment","opps":[{"id":"segregate","title":"Sort the waste","instruction":"Get a photo showing waste being separated for reuse, recycling or disposal.","question":"What are you separating here, and what will happen to each type of waste?","codes":["K4","S3","B2"],"bundle":"Environment & Sustainability"},{"id":"prevent_contam","title":"Prevent contamination","instruction":"Get a photo showing how materials, washout or waste are kept away from drains and surface water.","question":"How are you preventing contamination on this job?","codes":["K4","S3","B2"],"bundle":"Environment & Sustainability"},{"id":"efficient_use","title":"Use materials efficiently","instruction":"Get a photo showing materials being reused, stored carefully or used with minimal waste.","question":"What are you doing here to reduce waste or use materials efficiently?","codes":["K4","B2"],"bundle":"Environment & Sustainability"}]},{"id":"tools","title":"Using & looking after tools","opps":[{"id":"use_hand_tool","title":"Use a hand tool","instruction":"Get a photo showing a hand tool you are using for the job.","question":"What tool are you using, what is it for, and how are you using it safely?","codes":["K13","S8"],"bundle":"Materials & Tools"},{"id":"look_after_tool","title":"Look after your tools","instruction":"Get a photo showing a hand tool being cleaned, checked or stored.","question":"What do you check or do to keep this tool in good condition?","codes":["K13","S9"],"bundle":"Materials & Tools"},{"id":"use_power_tool","title":"Use a power tool","instruction":"Get a photo showing the power tool and the work it is being used for. Do not take the photo while operating it.","question":"What is this tool being used for, and what are its main limitations or risks?","codes":["K14","S8"],"bundle":"Materials & Tools"},{"id":"power_controls","title":"Power tool controls","instruction":"Get a photo showing the safety controls, guard, dust extraction or setup for the tool.","question":"What safety controls are you using with this tool?","codes":["K1","K14","S1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"}]}]},{"id":"setout","title":"Setting out","jobs":[{"id":"drawings","title":"Drawings & specifications","opps":[{"id":"read_drawing","title":"Use a drawing","instruction":"Get a photo of the drawing or specification you are working from, with personal information kept out of view.","question":"What information are you taking from this drawing for the work you are doing?","codes":["K10","S5"],"bundle":"Drawings & Information"},{"id":"digital_info","title":"Use digital information","instruction":"Get a screenshot or photo showing the digital drawing, model or information you are using.","question":"How is this digital information helping you carry out the job?","codes":["K11","S5"],"bundle":"Drawings & Information"},{"id":"standards_info","title":"Follow a standard / requirement","instruction":"Get a photo of the part of the work where a regulation, standard or specification matters.","question":"What requirement are you following here, and how does it affect the work?","codes":["K7","S4"],"bundle":"Drawings & Information"}]},{"id":"cavity_setout","title":"Setting out a cavity wall","opps":[{"id":"setout_line","title":"Set out the wall","instruction":"Get a photo showing the cavity wall lines or first-course setting out.","question":"How did you decide where the wall needed to go?","codes":["K21","S10"],"bundle":"Cavity Setting Out"},{"id":"setout_opening","title":"Set out an opening","instruction":"Get a photo showing the opening position or width being set out.","question":"How did you set out the opening and check it was the right size?","codes":["K21","S10"],"bundle":"Cavity Setting Out"},{"id":"profiles_gauge","title":"Profiles, gauge & square","instruction":"Get a photo showing profiles, a gauge rod, level or square being used.","question":"How are you using these to keep the wall to the right line, level, gauge or square?","codes":["K21","S10"],"bundle":"Cavity Setting Out"},{"id":"setout_drawing","title":"Work from the drawing","instruction":"Get a photo of the drawing or dimensions you used for the setting out.","question":"What dimensions or information did you take from the drawing?","codes":["K10","S5"],"bundle":"Drawings & Information"}]},{"id":"solid_setout_job","title":"Setting out a solid wall","opps":[{"id":"solid_setout","title":"Set out the wall","instruction":"Get a photo showing how the solid wall has been set out.","question":"How did you set this wall out before you started building?","codes":["K16","S13"],"bundle":"Solid Walling"}]},{"id":"systems","title":"Building systems & standards","opps":[{"id":"building_principles","title":"How the building works","instruction":"Get a photo showing a key building component such as a foundation, wall, floor, insulation, DPC or lintel.","question":"What does this component do as part of the building?","codes":["K6"],"bundle":"Building Principles"},{"id":"standards","title":"Work to the required standard","instruction":"Get a photo showing work being checked against a drawing, specification, regulation or warranty requirement.","question":"What standard or requirement are you checking this work against?","codes":["K7","S4"],"bundle":"Drawings & Information"},{"id":"mmc","title":"Modern method / alternative system","instruction":"Get a photo showing a modern or alternative construction method, support system, profile or prefabricated component.","question":"What is different about this method compared with traditional brick and block construction?","codes":["K9"],"bundle":"Building Principles"}]}]},{"id":"walls","title":"Building walls","jobs":[{"id":"cavity_build","title":"Building a cavity wall","opps":[{"id":"cavity_stretcher","title":"Build the wall","instruction":"Get a photo showing the brick and block cavity wall you are building.","question":"Talk me through how you are building the two leaves of this cavity wall.","codes":["K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"cavity_return","title":"Form a return","instruction":"Get a photo showing the return in the cavity wall.","question":"How did you form the return and keep the work accurate?","codes":["K22","S11","B3"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"close_cavity","title":"Close the cavity","instruction":"Get a photo showing the cavity being closed around an opening or end.","question":"How are you closing the cavity here, and why is it done this way?","codes":["K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"cavity_quality","title":"Check the work","instruction":"Get a photo showing a level, line, gauge or another check on the wall.","question":"What are you checking here, and what would you do if the work was out?","codes":["K6","K22","S11","B3"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"}]},{"id":"solid_build_job","title":"Building a solid wall","opps":[{"id":"solid_build","title":"Build & cap the wall","instruction":"Get a photo showing the solid wall or its capping.","question":"How are you building and capping this solid wall?","codes":["K16","S13"],"bundle":"Solid Walling"},{"id":"bond","title":"Bond pattern","instruction":"Get a photo showing the bond clearly.","question":"Which bond are you using here, and how is the pattern formed?","codes":["K15","S13"],"bundle":"Solid Walling"}]},{"id":"gable","title":"Gable / raking wall","opps":[{"id":"rake","title":"Build the rake","instruction":"Get a photo showing the raking section of the wall.","question":"How did you set out and form the rake on this wall?","codes":["K30","S22"],"bundle":"Cutting & Raking"},{"id":"cut_brick","title":"Measure & cut a brick","instruction":"Get a photo showing a brick or block you measured and cut for the rake.","question":"How did you measure and cut this piece to the size you needed?","codes":["K29","S15"],"bundle":"Cutting & Raking"},{"id":"gable_tools","title":"Tools for the job","instruction":"Get a photo showing the hand tools you are using for this work.","question":"Which tools are you using here, and how do you keep them in good condition?","codes":["K13","S8","S9"],"bundle":"Materials & Tools"},{"id":"gable_safe","title":"Work safely","instruction":"Get a photo showing your safe setup or PPE for the gable work.","question":"What are the main risks with this job, and how are you controlling them?","codes":["K1","K2","K3","S1","S2","S7","B1"],"bundle":"Safe Working"},{"id":"gable_protect","title":"Protect the gable","instruction":"If you protect the work before leaving, get a photo showing how.","question":"How are you protecting the work from weather or damage?","codes":["K25","S17","B3"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection"}]},{"id":"decorative_build","title":"Decorative brickwork & piers","opps":[{"id":"decorative_detail","title":"Decorative brickwork","instruction":"Get a photo showing the decorative or contrasting brickwork detail.","question":"What decorative detail are you forming here, and how is it built?","codes":["K18"],"bundle":"Specialist Brickwork"},{"id":"pier","title":"Build a pier","instruction":"Get a photo showing an isolated or attached pier you are working on.","question":"What type of pier is this, and how are you building it into the work?","codes":["K18"],"bundle":"Specialist Brickwork"}]}]},{"id":"details","title":"Openings & wall details","jobs":[{"id":"opening_lintel","title":"Opening, lintel & sill","opps":[{"id":"lintel","title":"Install the lintel","instruction":"Get a photo showing the lintel in position.","question":"How was the lintel installed and supported correctly?","codes":["K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"soldiers","title":"Soldier course","instruction":"Get a photo showing the soldiers over the opening.","question":"How did you set out and form the soldier course?","codes":["K23","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"brick_edge_sill","title":"Brick-on-edge sill","instruction":"Get a photo showing the brick-on-edge sill.","question":"How did you set out and build the brick-on-edge sill?","codes":["K23","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"opening_close","title":"Close around the opening","instruction":"Get a photo showing how the cavity is closed around the opening.","question":"What are you using to close the cavity around the opening, and why?","codes":["K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"}]},{"id":"ties_insulation","title":"Wall ties & insulation","opps":[{"id":"wall_ties","title":"Wall ties","instruction":"Get a photo showing the wall ties before they are covered.","question":"How did you decide where to place the wall ties on this job?","codes":["K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"insulation","title":"Insulation","instruction":"Get a photo showing the insulation being fitted in the cavity.","question":"How are you fitting the insulation so it performs properly?","codes":["K5","K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"thermal_detail","title":"Thermal detail","instruction":"Get a photo showing how insulation is kept continuous around an opening, junction or other detail.","question":"How does this detail help the building's thermal performance or airtightness?","codes":["K5"],"bundle":"Environment & Sustainability"}]},{"id":"damp_fire","title":"DPC, trays, weeps & fire stopping","opps":[{"id":"dpc","title":"DPC","instruction":"Get a photo showing the DPC before it is covered.","question":"Where is the DPC being used here, and what is it protecting the building from?","codes":["K6","K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"cavity_tray","title":"Cavity tray","instruction":"Get a photo showing the cavity tray being installed.","question":"Why is the cavity tray needed here, and how is it positioned?","codes":["K6","K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"weep_holes","title":"Weep holes","instruction":"Get a photo showing the weep holes at the cavity tray or opening.","question":"Why are the weep holes needed, and where should they be positioned?","codes":["K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"},{"id":"fire_stop","title":"Fire stopping","instruction":"Get a photo showing the fire stopping before it is covered.","question":"What is the fire stopping doing here, and how is it installed correctly?","codes":["K6","K22","S11"],"bundle":"Cavity Construction"}]},{"id":"movement_job","title":"Movement / expansion joints","opps":[{"id":"movement","title":"Movement / expansion joint","instruction":"Get a photo showing the movement or expansion joint.","question":"Why is this movement joint needed, and how is it formed?","codes":["K19"],"bundle":"Specialist Brickwork"}]},{"id":"special_courses","title":"Soldiers & brick-on-edge","opps":[{"id":"special_course","title":"Soldier / brick-on-edge detail","instruction":"Get a photo showing a soldier or brick-on-edge course.","question":"How did you set out and build this special course?","codes":["K23"],"bundle":"Specialist Brickwork"}]}]},{"id":"finish","title":"Finishing & site work","jobs":[{"id":"jointing","title":"Jointing","opps":[{"id":"joint_finish","title":"Form the joint","instruction":"Get a photo showing the joint finish you are forming.","question":"Which joint finish are you using here, and how are you forming it?","codes":["K17","S12"],"bundle":"Mortar & Jointing"},{"id":"joint_compare","title":"Choose the finish","instruction":"Get a photo showing the finished joints clearly.","question":"Why is this joint finish suitable for this work?","codes":["K17","S12"],"bundle":"Mortar & Jointing"}]},{"id":"repair_work","title":"Repair / defect work","opps":[{"id":"spot_defect","title":"Identify the defect","instruction":"Get a photo showing the defect before you repair it.","question":"What is wrong here, and what do you think caused it?","codes":["K24","B3"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection"},{"id":"make_repair","title":"Carry out the repair","instruction":"Get a photo showing the repair you have carried out.","question":"What repair did you make, and how did you make sure it was right?","codes":["K24","S16","B3"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection"},{"id":"protect_repair","title":"Protect the repair","instruction":"Get a photo showing how the repaired work is being protected.","question":"How are you protecting the repaired work while it cures or until the next stage?","codes":["K25","S17"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection"}]},{"id":"protect_work","title":"Protecting finished work","opps":[{"id":"cover_work","title":"Protect the work","instruction":"Get a photo showing finished work protected from weather or site damage.","question":"How are you protecting this work, and what could damage it if you did not?","codes":["K25","S17","B3"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection"},{"id":"protect_materials","title":"Protect materials","instruction":"Get a photo showing bricks, blocks or other materials stored and protected correctly.","question":"How are these materials being protected from water, frost or damage?","codes":["K25","S17"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection"}]},{"id":"communication_team","title":"Communication & teamwork","opps":[{"id":"site_communication","title":"Explain the job","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"Tell me about a conversation you had today where you used construction terms to explain the work clearly.","codes":["K26","S18"],"bundle":"Communication & Teamwork","media":"talk"},{"id":"ask_check","title":"Ask or check something","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"What did you need to ask or check with someone today, and how did you make sure you both understood?","codes":["K26","S18"],"bundle":"Communication & Teamwork","media":"talk"},{"id":"team_task","title":"Team task","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"What job did you work on with someone else today, and what was your part in it?","codes":["K27","S20","B6"],"bundle":"Communication & Teamwork","media":"talk"},{"id":"wider_team","title":"Work with another trade","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"How did your work today affect or depend on another person or trade?","codes":["K27","S20","B6"],"bundle":"Communication & Teamwork","media":"talk"}]},{"id":"site_life","title":"Learning, wellbeing & respect","opps":[{"id":"inclusive_work","title":"Work respectfully","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"Give me an example of how you made sure someone was included or treated fairly at work.","codes":["K28","S19","B4"],"bundle":"Inclusion, Wellbeing & Development","media":"talk"},{"id":"wellbeing_support","title":"Know where to get support","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"If you or someone at work was struggling, where could you go for support?","codes":["K31","S21"],"bundle":"Inclusion, Wellbeing & Development","media":"talk"},{"id":"wellbeing_first","title":"Look after wellbeing","instruction":"No photo needed for this one.","question":"What did you do today to keep yourself or others safe and well at work?","codes":["B1"],"bundle":"Safe Working","media":"talk"},{"id":"learn_new","title":"Learn something","instruction":"A photo is optional. You can simply tell Evia about it.","question":"What did you learn or practise today that will make you better at your job?","codes":["B5"],"bundle":"Inclusion, Wellbeing & Development","media":"talk"},{"id":"take_ownership","title":"Take ownership","instruction":"A photo is optional. You can simply tell Evia about it.","question":"Tell me about something you checked, corrected or took responsibility for today.","codes":["B3"],"bundle":"Repairs & Protection","media":"talk"}]}]}],"distribution":{"format":"nisi","containsLearnerData":false,"purpose":"Shared qualification definition for Nisi role apps"}}